<Base title="about" description="About Wes Roberts (@jchook).">
  <h1 class="page-title">about</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm <strong>Wes Roberts</strong> — <a href="https://github.com/jchook"
        >@jchook</a
      > most places. I write software, run Void Linux with xmonad, and live in
      neovim.
    </p>
    <p>
      This blog is short posts: things I built, things I fixed, and the
      occasional detour into physics or whatever else has my attention that
      week. Posts are stamped with wherever in the world I happen to be.
    </p>
    <p>
      The site itself is static <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a>, themed
      after my terminal — the palette is literally my <code>kitty.conf</code>,
      and the footer is my wallpaper: the Balmer series of hydrogen, remixed
      into gruvbox.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>github: <a href="https://github.com/jchook">github.com/jchook</a></li>
      <li>
        linkedin: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/wesleyroberts42"
          >linkedin.com/in/wesleyroberts42</a
        >
      </li>
      <li>rss: <a href="/rss.xml">/rss.xml</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
